      "text": "I traced `program.stamp` by hand against `spec.txt` and wrote the 35 printed values to `answer.txt`. I did not run it through an interpreter.\n\nThe traps I checked most carefully:\n- **`early`:** the first `CALL early` comes before its `DEF`, so it takes no arguments and yields 0.\n- **`outer`/`inner`:** `inner` reads `a` as a global, which is 0, so `CALL inner 100` gives 100 and `CALL inner 5` gives 5.\n- **`GLOBAL` after a local `SET`:** in `shadow`, `SET total 5` creates a local first. After `GLOBAL total`, both the print and the next `SET` use the global.\n- **`NEXT` on a local:** `tick` starts its local from the global value 101 and returns 102, leaving the global at 101.",
